      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Steam allows no floating numbers. So it can only be 1GB or 2GB. it's currently 1.05-1.1GB (or 1.02 GiB). At the time i wrote the wiki page VRChat was ~1.3GB iirc. and were seeming to raise further, which is why i wrote 1.5GB on the wiki. The Cache at the time was min 30GB. that changed. By default it's still 30GB, but can be lowered in the config to 20GB (No UI). In my opinion 21.5GB is the right answer (or 22GB for Steam) which is why i wrote that on the wiki, which then got addapted by the offical help page. But the update which allows you to set the cache to as low as 20GB seems to be missing on the docs.\n\nSteam: 22GB\n\ndocs (cache_size): Valid Values: Greater than or equal to 20 [GB]",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
